      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "9 \xB7 Multiple Effects at Once \u2014 two effects, two destinations\nOne
    reward fires BOTH: coins to the wallet (top-right) and xp orbs to the level bar
    (bottom).\nThey run concurrently and never disturb each other \u2014 one scheduler
    advances every effect.\nA2BDemoMultiPlay fires both players together; each is
    an ordinary A2BEffectPlayer."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
